Subject: [PATCH 1/2] =?UTF-8?q?fix(scripts):=20r=C3=A9tablir=20l'appel=20e?=
 =?UTF-8?q?nsureOrder(key)=20/=20restore=20ensureOrder(key)=20call?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

FR : ensureOrder est définie avec un seul paramètre (key). L'appel à deux
arguments (order, key) passait le tableau 'order' comme clé et l'y insérait.
Réf. : correctif automatique de la PR #139.

EN: ensureOrder is defined with a single parameter (key). The two-argument
call (order, key) passed the 'order' array as the key and pushed it into itself.
Ref: autofix from PR #139.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Scripts/fix-package-lock-merge.mjs | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Scripts/fix-package-lock-merge.mjs b/Scripts/fix-package-lock-merge.mjs
index cb818ba..b2194be 100644
--- a/Scripts/fix-package-lock-merge.mjs
+++ b/Scripts/fix-package-lock-merge.mjs
@@ -290,7 +290,7 @@ function upsert(map, order, key, obj, meta) {
   }
   if (!map.has(key)) {
     map.set(key, structuredClone(obj));
-    ensureOrder(order, key);
+    ensureOrder(key);
     report.merges.push({ key, action: 'insert', version: obj.version, ...meta });
     return;
   }
